{"lines":[{"h":0.034883720825555353,"x":0.0082135492060518081,"t":"@MirsIELTS","y":0.0058139535281626076,"w":0.30390144348144527,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.23265274047851564,"y":0.047862252843400288,"t":"Sample Writing answers","x":0.094131180691894703,"h":0.018815195876940249},{"y":0.095870205958771715,"c":1,"t":"TEST 2, WRITING TASK 1","h":0.021862351859213702,"x":0.094455857140004915,"w":0.35934290568033855},{"c":1,"x":0.0944558423825229,"y":0.13362831872538083,"w":0.69609858194986973,"h":0.016224188790560534,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 6.5 score."},{"x":0.094400562345974215,"w":0.81733922322591135,"c":1,"h":0.021253463159971897,"t":"The maps give the information about the improvement of the Porth Harbour from 2000 to today.","y":0.15918010416937878},{"x":0.094455850100004762,"t":"The first impression is that the Harbour today made use of more areas than in the past.","c":1,"y":0.18168604700564173,"h":0.018903923597307748,"w":0.73921971638997397},{"x":0.094455840153545592,"w":0.82546203613281255,"c":1,"t":"It can be seen that there are several areas that still stay the same today as in 2000. These include","h":0.019016257992184649,"y":0.20930232607605148},{"w":0.82751541137695306,"h":0.01902140276973574,"c":1,"t":"the Carpark and the Showers and Toilets which are located in the north west of the map. However,","x":0.094455846754824505,"y":0.22965116327729884},{"w":0.83778233846028638,"c":1,"h":0.019026548672566368,"t":"one more Showers and Toilets are built between the two Carpark today. Besides, the Porth Harbour","x":0.094455857104558921,"y":0.25000000026102465},{"w":0.7926077779134113,"h":0.019016257992184649,"y":0.27168141592659367,"t":"today also has one more Passenger ferries which right next to the left of the existing one from","x":0.094455864532919515,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.094392411047467512,"y":0.29057791014580925,"w":0.83587249755859372,"h":0.022432533196643512,"t":"2000. Moreover, an area for Cafes and shops is added next to the Lifeboat one. Another significant"},{"y":0.31238938037131503,"h":0.020459456992360292,"x":0.096509246721902378,"c":1,"t":"difference is the relocation of the Marina (private yachts) and the fishing boats areas. Today, the","w":0.80698150634765631},{"t":"Marina is moved down to the place of the old Fishing boats area to have more space and vice-","x":0.096509246475362243,"w":0.79876795450846361,"h":0.019000822534251616,"y":0.33274336301190477,"c":1},{"t":"versa, the Fishing boats area is relocated at the old Marina area. The last noticeable change in this","y":0.3530973449987993,"x":0.094455859433963008,"h":0.018995677756700635,"c":1,"w":0.83162216186523441},{"y":0.37345132698245198,"w":0.7987679545084635,"h":0.018990532979149322,"c":1,"x":0.096509246589026251,"t":"Harbour is the Construction in the South East. The disused old Castle was destroyed and a new"},{"w":0.72073923746744784,"x":0.096509231297346981,"t":"Hotel was built there today and another Hotel Is also added in the Private beach area.","y":0.39380531009673958,"h":0.018985387076318805,"c":1},{"t":"Overall, even that the harbour still keeps some areas unchanged, there are many reconstructions","y":0.42296511677115167,"c":1,"w":0.81108830769856777,"x":0.096509234121098186,"h":0.018922788906941435},{"y":0.44331395398012741,"h":0.018927933684492526,"w":0.40451746622721352,"c":1,"t":"and improvements for the Porth Harbour today.","x":0.09650923392832747},{"c":1,"h":0.014561466340821783,"x":0.096509243719622148,"t":"Here is the examiner's comment:","y":0.47817109158194304,"w":0.31416837056477864},{"c":1,"x":0.14373717819845921,"y":0.50726744188391759,"t":"Overall, this is a strong response. The candidate has covered the main features of","h":0.017511319410836057,"w":0.77618067423502601},{"y":0.52616279072150574,"w":0.76796712239583331,"h":0.017495026489977916,"x":0.14168378982905266,"c":1,"t":"the changes and has included an overview to summarise the changes, in the first"},{"c":1,"y":0.54360465118651025,"h":0.017457295870710654,"t":"and the last paragraph. The main details are accurate, apart from the addition of","x":0.14373717123866953,"w":0.75770019531249999},{"h":0.015988371857499684,"x":0.13963038821558607,"t":"[another Hotel] in the private beach area.","y":0.56104651161243235,"c":1,"w":0.39425051371256514},{"x":0.14373716505612927,"y":0.58997050139367591,"h":0.017699115044247815,"w":0.76386037190755207,"c":1,"t":"The reader can follow the ideas as they are logically organised. This is due to the"},{"x":0.13963038914338588,"t":"linking words [However | Besides | also | Another | Overall] and cohesive features","y":0.60901162802239417,"c":1,"w":0.77207392374674466,"h":0.016062118170183992},{"c":1,"x":0.14168377496033779,"w":0.50308008829752604,"h":0.01602438755091673,"y":0.62645348848231319,"t":"[existing one | vice-versa], but there are some errors."},{"w":0.76193013509114582,"y":0.65442514089628112,"t":"Vocabulary demonstrates some flexibility [first impression | relocated | noticeable","h":0.018814459381553683,"c":1,"x":0.14367344797981482},{"h":0.017545619615762953,"x":0.14373718783651621,"w":0.72895273844401032,"y":0.67286135688423054,"t":"change], but there is also some inaccuracy and repetition. The weakest area,","c":1},{"t":"though, is the use of grammatical structures. There is a mix of sentence forms, with","w":0.78439422607421871,"y":0.69026548662031839,"h":0.019174041297935096,"c":1,"x":0.14373717063845542},{"h":0.016066406047449799,"c":1,"y":0.70930232569676366,"t":"some good complex use [made use of | can be seen that | These include ... which","x":0.1437371784554701,"w":0.78439422607421883},{"t":"are] but some errors, such as inaccurate use of the plural [one more Showers |","y":0.72549999202944082,"x":0.14367117270382304,"h":0.019225536335182758,"c":1,"w":0.74550806681315107},{"y":0.74563953499936786,"w":0.77618067423502601,"t":"boats areas (because the candidate has copied the plural form from the question)","x":0.14373717818022821,"h":0.016012382507324285,"c":1},{"w":0.62031967163085933,"y":0.76039580928952322,"x":0.14366574949305763,"h":0.018737151559475307,"c":1,"t":"and incorrect verb form [is moved down | has been moved down]."},{"t":"To achieve a higher score, the candidate should present an overview to summarise","w":0.78234085083007809,"h":0.017699115044247815,"c":1,"x":0.14373717199230271,"y":0.7920353980047522},{"x":0.14373717817388335,"w":0.77618067423502612,"c":1,"h":0.017699115044247704,"t":"the main stages, for example: The changes to the harbour between 2000 and now","y":0.81091445448419086},{"x":0.14168378313989119,"c":1,"w":0.75770019531249999,"y":0.82848837220850746,"h":0.016054400441217531,"t":"focus on improvements that are targeted towards attracting visitors or tourists to"},{"t":"the harbour, and include a new hotel, with private beach, more capacity for the","h":0.01749159607563755,"c":1,"w":0.73921971638997397,"y":0.84593023258113753,"x":0.14373716431686659},{"h":0.019140303170083195,"c":1,"t":"passenger ferries and expanded facilities.","x":0.14359501670485622,"y":0.86204166494368806,"w":0.39652605692545573},{"t":"130","y":0.92296511652055568,"w":0.036960986455281578,"x":0.09856262786625504,"h":0.013081394746943587,"c":1},{"t":"IELTSXpress.com","x":0.51176470218665204,"y":0.94166666659226195,"w":0.45294118245442705,"c":1,"h":0.04166666666666663}],"h":3390,"w":2400}